Bluefin and dYdX perpetual contracts
  The MNX contracts started from Bluefin's EVM exchange contracts
  (https://github.com/fireflyprotocol/bluefin-exchange-contracts-evm),
  which build on dYdX's v1 perpetual contracts
  (https://github.com/dydxprotocol/perpetual). Bluefin's repository has an
  Apache-2.0 root LICENSE, while its Solidity files carry GPL-3.0-or-later
  SPDX notices. dYdX's code is Copyright 2020 dYdX Trading Inc. and licensed
  under the Apache License, Version 2.0. contracts/libraries/Require.sol and
  contracts/libraries/TypedSignature.sol, and their copies under
  deployed-builds/, are modified versions of dYdX files and keep dYdX's
  notice.

